Origin
------
ccleft's provider probe logic was seeded from the quota probers of Hive
(https://github.com/hivecommons/hive, src/pkg/rotation), Copyright 2026 The
KubeStellar Authors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. In
particular the normalized limit-window shape, the "failed measurement is never
headroom" rule, the agy /usage envelope parsing and the
testdata/agy_usage.json capture (agy 1.2.1) come from that code.

